                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Describe a time when you got lost.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " You should say: where you were · how you got lost · what you did · and explain how you felt."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I'd like to tell you about the time I got lost in Lisbon, about three years ago. I was there on a work trip, and on my last evening I decided to explore the old neighbourhood of Alfama on my own.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "At first, everything was fine — I was taking photos of the colourful houses and listening to music coming from little restaurants. But the streets there are like a maze: narrow, steep and full of stairs. After a while, I realised I had no idea where I was, and to make things worse, my phone battery had died.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I was starting to feel quite nervous because it was getting dark. Eventually, I went into a small bakery and, with my basic Portuguese — well, Brazilian Portuguese — I asked for directions. The owner was incredibly kind; she drew me a little map on a napkin.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In the end, I found my hotel about an hour later, absolutely exhausted but relieved. Looking back, I actually feel grateful it happened, because it was the most authentic moment of the whole trip.",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
